B.Tn=new A.bx(13,2,"\ud83d\udcb0","Salary negotiation in English","H\u1ecd offer m\xecnh c\xf4ng vi\u1ec7c! Nh\u01b0ng m\u1ee9c l\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng. Ph\u1ea3i negotiate. M\xecnh ch\u01b0a bao gi\u1edd negotiate b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Anh. \u0110\xe2y l\xe0 k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng m\xecnh c\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t.",B.Xs,B.a_l,B.YC,"You are the hiring manager offering me a position. We need to negotiate salary and benefits. Start with a lower offer and see how I negotiate. Be realistic.","They offer a lower salary but better benefits! Evaluate the full package","\ud83e\udd14")
